SUMMARY
================================================================================

  Non-perturbative J-invariance test of the Euclidean path integral Z =
  Tr f(D_K^2/Lambda^2) over the L_max = 7 mode basis (1077120 weighted modes,
  20064 unique eigenvalues, 36 PW sectors).

  Key results:
     ln Z           = -3.989104e+05
